&lt;li&gt;Perform and review group consolidation activities and IFRS reporting for the Awin Group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and support monthly and annual group closing activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and review intercompany reconciliations, group reporting packages and related group-level deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare financial analysis and management reporting to support transparent and reliable group-level insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and coordinate audit requests as well as shareholder reporting requirements related to group reporting and consolidation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive process and system improvements in the group reporting and consolidation landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a point of contact for local finance teams on group-wide IFRS and consolidation-related accounting topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as process owner for Awin’s consolidation tool LucaNet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role offers the opportunity to take ownership of key group reporting processes and contribute to the further development of Awin’s international finance and consolidation landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of professional experience in a comparable group accounting, consolidation or audit-related role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of consolidation processes, including intercompany reconciliation, reporting packages and group-level financial statements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong practical knowledge of IFRS and good understanding of local GAAP requirements; tax knowledge is beneficial but not essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Microsoft Excel skills and practical experience with ERP, reporting and consolidation tools such as Microsoft D365 and LucaNet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player with a global mindset and the ability to build international working relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, accurate and proactive way of working, with the ability to deliver high-quality results in a dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under pressure and prioritise effectively during tight reporting deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in group accounting, consolidation or audit environment preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional qualification such as CPA, ACCA, ACA, IFRS Accountant, German “Bilanzbuchhalter” is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very good written and verbal communication skills in English, combined with strong analytical and interpersonal skills (company language: English)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Further languages (Romanian/German) are an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
