&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3097&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9c87bed45e7a&quot;&gt;Build and productionize model-compression workflows, including quantization, quantization-aware training, distillation, low-bit serving, and accuracy recovery.&lt;/p&gt;
