&lt;p&gt;Capco is a global technology and business consultancy, focused on the financial services sector. We are passionate about helping our clients succeed in an ever-changing industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a senior software engineer with strong ML and GenAI skills to deliver end-to-end machine learning solutions for our financial services clients. You&#39;ll own the full lifecycle&amp;nbsp;&lt;span lang=&quot;ZH-TW&quot;&gt;—&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;from data pipelines and model development through production deployment and monitoring&amp;nbsp;&lt;span lang=&quot;ZH-TW&quot;&gt;—&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;working autonomously in complex, regulated environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW25675487 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW25675487 BCX0&quot;&gt;This is your chance to make a real difference!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW25675487 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR CAPCO DAY&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Design and build end-to-end data pipelines and feature engineering workflows on large-scale transactional data in regulated client environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Train, calibrate, and validate ML models — supervised, unsupervised, and ensemble — including threshold analysis and production-grade explainability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Develop GenAI-powered solutions such as agentic workflows, RAG systems, and LLM-based automation to accelerate knowledge-intensive client processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Deploy and monitor models in production with drift detection, performance tracking, and multi-environment release management (Dev → Staging → Prod)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Work directly with client stakeholders — from compliance SMEs to engineering teams — delivering documentation, knowledge transfer, and long-term enablement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR CAPCO FIT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Strong software engineering foundation: Python, Spark, CI/CD, containerized deployments (Kubernetes), and production-grade pipeline orchestration (Airflow or equivalent)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
